 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "One unit: the reciter joins 47→53 (about 258 s). Paradise, the Fire, the heights, water and food: nothing literal (no water or river motif). Who is told «ادخلوا الجنة» (49:8-12) is not glossed (Al-Muyassar: the people of the heights). «ننساهم» carries Al-Muyassar's «ويتركهم في العذاب». A book for «بكتاب فصلناه», an hourglass for «تأويله». First-person «جئناهم… بينا» not used."
